HOW TO READ THIS:
  COMPLETED_EMPTY on every keyword of a domain
      -> 'returned no records' is supportable for THIS run, on
         this date. It says nothing about 2026-03-18.
  EXEC_LIMIT_REJECTED on any keyword
      -> that domain's null cannot be read as absence; add query
         execution failure as a fourth cause in Section 3.1.
  COMPLETED with raw_rows > 0 in a domain originally reported empty
      -> the original zero came from first-seen dedup in
         uri_to_domain, not from the endpoint. This would also make
         the 1,477 / 699 split an artefact of iteration order.
